# The Clerk `__client` cookie from suno.com. Lives about 7 days.
#
# Get it: log into suno.com, devtools > Application > Cookies > suno.com,
# copy the value of `__client`. A full "Cookie: ..." header pasted whole also
# works; the client extracts the field it needs.
#
# This is a session credential for a paid account. Never commit it.
SUNO_COOKIE=

# Optional: where the client persists its session (default: XDG config, 0600).
# SUNO_AUTH_FILE=/run/secrets/suno-auth.json
